  "title": "Spotify and Merlin Announce Licensing Agreement for Fan-Made Covers and Remixes",
  "summary": "Spotify and Merlin today announced a new licensing agreement for Spotify’s upcoming fan-made covers and remixing tool, which will give listeners a new way to engage with the music they love from participating artists and songwriters. The agreement enables artists on labels under Merlin’s Spotify agreement the option to participate. As previously announced, Spotify’s tool...",
